---
import { site } from "../site";
---

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="founder-title">
  <div class="note reveal">
    <img src="/kunal.png" alt="Kunal Dholiya" width="72" height="72" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
    <div class="body">
      <h2 id="founder-title">
        Hi, I'm Kunal. <span class="dim">I'm building send0.</span>
      </h2>
      <p>
        I build software for a living, and more and more of it is agents. They keep hitting the same wall: email. Signing up for a tool
        needs a verification code. A supplier replies to a purchase order. A customer answers a support thread. The agent needs an inbox of
        its own, and there wasn't a good way to give it one.
      </p>
      <p>
        The hosted options were closed source, and some kept basics like webhooks for their priciest plans. Running your own mail server
        means weeks of DNS, deliverability and MIME edge cases before you write any agent code.
      </p>
      <p>
        So I'm building the inbox API I wanted: open source, webhooks on every plan, and free to run on your own servers.
        {site.repoPublic ? "I'm building it in public." : "The code opens with the beta."}
        If you're giving agents email, I'd like to hear what you need.
      </p>
      <div class="sign">
        <div>
          <strong>Kunal Dholiya</strong>
          <span>Founder, send0</span>
        </div>
        <div class="links mono">
          <a href={site.founderGithub} rel="noopener">
            github.com/kunal-dd
          </a>
          <a href={`mailto:${site.email.hello}`}>{site.email.hello}</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .note {
    display: grid;
    gap: 28px;
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  @media (min-width: 720px) {
    .note {
      grid-template-columns: 72px 1fr;
      gap: 36px;
    }
  }
  img {
    width: 72px;
    height: 72px;
    border-radius: 18px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--surface);
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: clamp(26px, 3.4vw, 34px);
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .dim {
    color: var(--fg-faint);
  }
  .body p {
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--fg-muted);
  }
  .body p + p {
    margin-top: 16px;
  }
  .sign {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-end;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-top: 32px;
    padding-top: 24px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .sign strong {
    display: block;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .sign span {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--fg-faint);
  }
  .links {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 6px 20px;
    font-size: 13px;
  }
  .links a {
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    transition: color 0.15s ease;
  }
  .links a:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
</style>
